+## Request
+
+Export `createPatch(from, to)` from `src/index.ts`: a JSON Patch (RFC 6902) turning `from` into `to`, not
+mutating inputs, describing only what changed; array insertions/removals are single add/remove, moves do not
+rewrite items in between.
